" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Weight: 0.05 kg (0.1 lb)</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Price: 14 gp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Price:  14  gp</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"￼START_WIDGET&quot;'-17032b5092cbb78cEND_WIDGET ￼START_WIDGET&quot;'-8ca8be666bca4644END_WIDGET\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">UNI_BOOK_LOW_StormshoreTabernacle_TabernacleDonations</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:UNI_BOOK_LOW_StormshoreTabernacle_TabernacleDonations\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:UNI_BOOK_LOW_StormshoreTabernacle_TabernacleDonations\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UUID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">22ff2ddd-cbf6-419c-b5cc-26a1a0fb229d</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:22ff2ddd-cbf6-419c-b5cc-26a1a0fb229d\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:22ff2ddd-cbf6-419c-b5cc-26a1a0fb229d\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>On the floor of <a href=\"/wiki/Stormshore_Tabernacle\" title=\"Stormshore Tabernacle\">Stormshore Tabernacle</a> at <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;116&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;-16</span></li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Text\"> Text </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-book-text\">\n<p>We wish not to hide the generosity of the Gate's gathered faithful. All donations are used in the upkeep of the Tabernacle and payment of its staff.\n</p><p>This wonderful season:\n</p><p><b><a href=\"/wiki/Helm_(deity)\" title=\"Helm (deity)\">HELM</a></b> - 50,000 GP, nine cattle flock, a selection of precious gemstones, sixteen severed eyes (please note: offerings of viscera are highly discouraged at on Tabernacle premises.\n</p><p><b><a href=\"/wiki/Sel%C3%BBne\" title=\"Selûne\">SELÛNE</a></b> - 47,000 GP, a shipment of magic lamps, three parlour mirrors (alabaster, wrought iron, and silver), more candles than we've been able to count\n</p><p><br>\nThanks to her flock's generous donations to the Tabernacle's coffers, we are proud to announce a newly commissioned statue of the bountiful Tymora. May her luck by with you.\n</p>\n</div>    \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714221243\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.047 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.050 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1330/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 25899/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 8007/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 22/200\nExpensive parser function count: 1/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.010/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 931403/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   39.819      1 Template:MiscItemPage\n100.00%   39.819      1 -total\n 48.98%   19.505      6 Template:Icon_text\n 43.65%   17.380     15 Template:Trim\n 23.78%    9.467      2 Template:Uid\n 15.80%    6.291      1 Template:Main_only\n 13.61%    5.421      2 Template:Template_style\n 11.70%    4.660      1 Template:PageSeo\n 11.47%    4.567      2 Template:Hidden_code\n 10.45%    4.162      1 Template:Notes\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:31449-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714221243 and revision id 394295. Rendering was triggered because: unknown\n -->\n</div>"}